Source: @PKG@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Dhivakar R <dhivakar1010@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/Dhiva-Labs/FlintBrowser
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: @PKG@
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-3-0, libnotify4, libnss3, libxss1, libxtst6, xdg-utils, libatspi2.0-0, libuuid1, libsecret-1-0
Description: Fast, private web browser (@NAME@) with built-in ad blocking
 @NAME@ is a fast, private, batteries-included web browser by Dhiva Labs.
 .
 Built-in EasyList/EasyPrivacy ad and tracker blocking at the network
 level, DNS-over-HTTPS with selectable providers, multi-connection turbo
 downloads with pause and resume, reader mode, private windows,
 HTTPS-first mode, session restore, and zero telemetry.
